{"id": "17-157-2-16", "zh": "由“ca”字，sādhu 中的 dha 音有时变为 ha 音，例如：sāhu dassanaṃ（见到是好的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-158-2-5", "zh": "在“yathā eva”“tathā eva”这样的情况下，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-159-2-17", "zh": "“navā（或不）”一词延续下来，“saramhā（在元音之后）”一词也延续下来。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-160-2-11", "zh": "28. eva 的首音变为 ri，前面的元音也变短。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-161-2-5", "zh": "这条规则只用于 yathā 与 tathā 两词之后。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-161-6-22", "zh": "在长元音之后，eva 字首的 e 音可以变为 ri 音，同时前面的元音变短；这是可选的。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-161-23-26", "zh": "例如 yathariva、tathariva。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-161-27-30", "zh": "为什么说“**navā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-161-31-34", "zh": "因为也可以作 yatheva、tatheva。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-162-2-32", "zh": "在 ti antaṃ、ti addhaṃ、aggi agāre、sattamī atthe、pañcamī antaṃ、du aṅgikaṃ、bhikkhu āsane、puthu āsane、sayambhū āsane 这些情况下，当 ya、va 替代音将要适用时——", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-163-2-9", "zh": "“saññā（名称）”一词延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-164-2-7", "zh": "29. i 类元音与 u 类元音称为 jha 与 la。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-165-2-7", "zh": "i 类元音与 u 类元音依次得名为 jha 与 la。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-165-8-11", "zh": "用“vaṇṇa（类）”字，是为了把同类的元音（长短两种）都包括进来。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-166-2-8", "zh": "jha 与 la 的名称就像 pa 的名称一样，并不只依附于词干末尾；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-167-2-9", "zh": "因为在动词里、在词干中间以及在两种性别的词干末尾都能见到它们。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "17-168-2-8", "zh": "30. 后面是元音时，jha 与 la 可以变为 iya 与 uva。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-169-2-13", "zh": "后面是元音时，jha 与 la 可以分别替换为 iya 与 uva，并删除元音。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-170-2-19", "zh": "例如 tiyantaṃ、tiyaddhaṃ、aggiyāgāre、sattamiyatthe、pañcamiyantaṃ、duvaṅgikaṃ、bhikkhuvāsane、puthuvāsane、sayambhuvāsane。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-170-20-23", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-170-24-30", "zh": "因为也可以作 agyāgāre、sattamīatthe、bhikkhuāsane nisīdati（坐在比丘的座位上）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-171-2-7", "zh": "在 go ajinaṃ、go eḷakaṃ 这样的情况下，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-172-2-14", "zh": "“go”“avo”“samāse”这几个词延续下来。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-173-2-9", "zh": "31. 后面是元音时，o 也（替换为 ava）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-174-2-12", "zh": "在复合词中，后面是元音时，go 的 o 音替换为 ava。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-174-13-16", "zh": "例如 gavājinaṃ、gaveḷakaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-174-17-22", "zh": "由于用了“ca”字，u 类元音也可替换为 uva 与 ava。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-174-23-28", "zh": "例如：bhuvi、pasavo。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-175-2-3", "zh": "在 putha eva 这样的情况下，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-176-2-9", "zh": "32. 后面是元音时，putha 有时增加 ga 音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-177-2-12", "zh": "后面是元音时，不变词 putha 的末尾有时增加 ga 音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-177-13-18", "zh": "加进来的叫作 āgama（增音）；原本没有而出现，就是增音。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-177-19-31", "zh": "这里，因为“sare”这一条件紧邻在后，可以推知增音是加在 putha 的末尾。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-177-32-36", "zh": "例如 puthageva，也可作 putha eva。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-178-2-3", "zh": "在 pā eva 这样的情况下，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-179-2-16", "zh": "“sare”“go”“āgamo”“kvaci”这几个词延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-180-2-8", "zh": "33. pā 的末尾元音也变短。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-181-2-19", "zh": "后面是元音时，pā 的末尾有时增加 ga 音，同时 pā 的末尾元音变短。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-181-20-25", "zh": "例如 pageva vutyassa，也可作 pā eva。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-182-2-12", "zh": "“vā”“sare”这两个词延续下来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-183-2-13", "zh": "34. y、v、m、d、n、t、r、l 也是增音。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-184-2-10", "zh": "后面是元音时，可以增加 ya 音等八个增音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-184-11-20", "zh": "由“ca”字，也可增加 ga 音；这里的“vā”字表示有定选择。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-185-2-8", "zh": "其中，ya 音增音用于 yathā 等词之后、i 音和 e 音等之前。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-185-9-69", "zh": "例如 yathā idaṃ 成为 yathayidaṃ，依据“byañjane（辅音在后）”这一管辖条文，按“rassaṃ”规则变短；也可作 yathā idaṃ；yathā eva 成为 yathāyeva，也可作 yatheva；同样有 māyidaṃ、māyevaṃ、taṃyidaṃ、taṃyeva、nayidaṃ、nayimassa、nayimāni、navayime dhammā、buddhānaṃyeva、santiyeva、bodhiyāyeva、satiyeva、pathavīyeva、dhātuyeva、tesuyeva、soyeva、pāṭiyekkaṃ。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-186-2-7", "zh": "同样，后面是元音时，在 vi、pari 等词之后也增加 ya 音。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "17-186-8-19", "zh": "vi añjanā 成为 viyañjanā，也可作 byañjanā；同样有 viyākāsi、byākāsi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-186-20-32", "zh": "pari antaṃ 成为 pariyantaṃ，同样有 pariyādānaṃ、pariyuṭṭhānaṃ、pariyesati、pariyosānaṃ，这些都是必然增加的。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-186-33-36", "zh": "ni āyogo 成为 niyāyogo。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-186-37-44", "zh": "下面这些不增加：parikkhato、upaparikkhati。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-187-2-6", "zh": "**va 音**增音：用于 ti 等词之后、a 类元音与 u 音之前。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-187-7-23", "zh": "ti aṅgulaṃ 成为 tivaṅgulaṃ，同样有 tivaṅgikaṃ、bhūvādayo、migī bhantā vudikkhati、pavuccati、pāguññavujutā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-188-2-7", "zh": "ma 音增音：用于 lahu 等词之后、元音之前，在维护韵律等情况下使用。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-188-8-34", "zh": "lahu essati 成为 lahumessati，同样有 garumessati、idhamāhu、kena te idha mijjhati、bhadro kasāmiva、ākāse mabhipūjayi、ekamekassa、yena midhekacce、āsatimeva。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-189-2-19", "zh": "da 音增音：用于前缀 u，以及 saki、kenaci、kiñci、kismiñci、koci、sammā、yāva、tāva、puna、ya、ta、eta、atta、sa 等词之后。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-189-20-40", "zh": "在前缀 u 之后是必然增加的：u aggo 成为 udaggo，同样有 udayo、udapādi、udāhaṭaṃ、udito、udīritaṃ、udeti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-190-2-17", "zh": "在不变词之后也增加：saki eva 成为 sakideva；同样有 sakadāgāmi，这里依据大规则把 i 音变为 a 音。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-190-18-32", "zh": "同样有 kenacideva、kiñcideva、kismiñcideva、kocideva；sammā attho 成为 sammadattho，元音变短。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-190-33-48", "zh": "同样有 sammadakkhāto、sammadaññā vimuttānaṃ、sammadeva、yāvadatthaṃ、yāvadeva、tāvadeva、punadeva。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-191-2-20", "zh": "在名词之后：yadatthaṃ、tadatthaṃ、yadantarā、tadantarā、tadaṅgavimutti、etadatthaṃ、attadatthaṃ、sadatthapasuto siyā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-191-21-23", "zh": "在 ya、ta、eta、atta、sa 之后，只在复合词里增加。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-192-2-14", "zh": "由“ādi（等）”字，还有 aññadatthaṃ、manasādaññā vimuttānaṃ、bahudeva rattiṃ、ahudeva bhayaṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-193-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**vā**”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-193-6-19", "zh": "因为也有不增加的：kenaci atthakāmena、sammā aññāya、yāvāhaṃ、tāvāhaṃ、punāparaṃ、attatthaṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-194-2-4", "zh": "na 音增音：用于 āyati 等词之前。", "confidence": 76}
{"id": "17-194-5-12", "zh": "ito āyati 成为 ito nāyati，又如 ciraṃ nāyati。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-195-2-7", "zh": "ta 音增音：用于 yasmā、tasmā、ajja 等词之后、iha、agga 等词之前。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "17-195-8-13", "zh": "例如 yasmātiha、tasmātiha、ajjatagge。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-2-10", "zh": "ra 音增音：用于 ni、du、pātu、puna、dhī、pāta、catu 等词之后。", "confidence": 74}
{"id": "17-196-11-25", "zh": "ni antaraṃ 成为 nirantaraṃ，同样有 nirālayo、nirindhano、nirīhakaṃ、niruttaro、nirojaṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-26-33", "zh": "du atikkamo 成为 duratikkamo，又如 durāgataṃ、duruttaṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-34-37", "zh": "例如 pāturahosi、pāturahesuṃ。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-38-45", "zh": "例如 punarāgaccheyya、punaruttaṃ、punareva、punareti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-46-47", "zh": "例如 dhiratthu。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-196-48-49", "zh": "例如 pātarāso。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "17-197-2-12", "zh": "在 catu 等词之后：caturaṅgikaṃ、caturārakkhā、caturiddhipādapaṭilābho、caturoghanittharaṇatthaṃ。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-197-13-18", "zh": "又如 bhatturatthe、vuttiresā、pathavīdhāturevesā。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "17-198-2-6", "zh": "同样，为了维护韵律，在元音之后、iva 与 eva 之前也增加 ra 音。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "17-198-7-22", "zh": "例如 nakkhattarājāriva tārakānaṃ、vijjurivabbhakūṭe、āraggeriva sāsapo、sāsaporiva āragge、usabhoriva、sabbhireva samāsetha。", "confidence": 80}
